OL,3,ABurnham to visit Kyiv on first foreign
OL,4,Atrip and reaffirm UK support for
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will mark his first
OL,8,Fforeign visit as prime minister with a
OL,9,Ftrip to Kyiv on Monday to reiterate the
OL,10,FUK's support for Ukraine and honour the
OL,11,Fcountry's independence day.
OL,13,FThe prime minister will chair his first
OL,14,Fmeeting of the "coalition of the
OL,15,Fwilling", set up by the UK and France
OL,16,Funder his predecessor, Sir Keir
OL,17,FStarmer.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
