OL,3,ABurnham to visit Kyiv on first foreign
OL,4,Atrip and reaffirm UK support for
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is also set to accept an award on
OL,8,Fbehalf of the British people
OL,9,Frecognising the UK's support for
OL,10,FUkraine and to take part in
OL,11,Findependence day events.
OL,13,FBurnham will be reaffirming the UK's
OL,14,Fbacking for Kyiv in the wake of
OL,15,Fescalating Russian strikes on Ukraine
OL,16,Fin recent weeks - including one on a
OL,17,Fshopping centre on Friday that killed
OL,18,Fat least 16 people.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
