OL,3,AShein aims for almost $27bn valuation
OL,4,Ain stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-awaited move comes after
OL,7,Ffailed attempts to list in the US and
OL,8,FLondon due to regulatory challenges
OL,9,Famid scrutiny of Shein, which has its
OL,10,Fheadquarters in Singapore but was
OL,11,Ffounded in China.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
